   "subject": "Re: plotOutput inside wellPanel with multiple columns",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I think the problem is that the div needs a width specified - otherwise it defaults to 0 width. For example, this fixes it:<div><br></div><div><div>    div(style=&quot;display:inline-block; width: 100%&quot;,</div><div>            wellPanel(plotOutput(outputId = &quot;plot2&quot;))),</div><div><br></div></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
